"update-hbbtv-recipes":
=======================

Use after update to "github.com/OpenViX/HbbTv2.0".
It pulls changes from "https://github.com/OpenViX/HbbTv2.0/tree/master/recipes-local/*" into "~/$BUILD_VERSION/meta-local/recipes-local"

========================================================================================================================================


"ipk_compare.py":
=================

Let's us take snapshots of the ipk folder.
e.g.

Take a "before" snapshot: "python3 ~/ipk_compare.py snapshot ~/before.json"

Now do some build process...

Take an "after" snapshot: "python3 ~/ipk_compare.py snapshot ~/after.json"

Now check what new packages have been created:
python3 ~/ipk_compare.py compare ~/before.json ~/after.json

========================================================================================================================================


"collect_hbbtv_feed.py"
=======================

Grabs the created ipks and moves them to "~/www/feed-static-6.0" sub folders based on arch.
Afterwards recreates "Packages" and "Packages.gz" using "recreate_feed.py" (not supplied here).

"~/collect_hbbtv_feed.py" to see args list.

"~/collect_hbbtv_feed.py --dry-run --extras"
"~/collect_hbbtv_feed.py --extras --index"

python3 recreate_feed.py <folder>              # older versions are deleted
python3 recreate_feed.py <folder> --keep-old   # older versions go to <folder>/old/
./collect_hbbtv_feed.py --index                # deletes
./collect_hbbtv_feed.py --index --keep-old     # passes the switch on
